  "category": "Dry",
  "description": "Cozy up with a steamy bowl of Campbell's Condensed Tomato Bisque Soup. An indulgent twist on classic canned tomato soup, this vegetarian soup is crafted with farm-fresh cream and tasty tomato pieces. The result is a creamy tomato bisque that contains one serving of veggies in every cup. Top it with oyster crackers, season it with fresh herbs, or pair it with a classic grilled cheese sandwich for something quick and easy. This convenient canned soup is a year-round pantry staple and the perfect comfort food on a chilly day or when you're feeling under the weather. Simply mix the condensed soup with 1 can of water and microwave on high for 2.5 to 3 minutes in a covered, microwave-safe bowl, or heat in a pot on the stove, stirring occasionally. Each 10.75 oz recyclable can contains about 2.5 servings of microwave soup and features a non-BPA lining. From Tomato Bisque to Cream of Mushroom and everything in between, Campbell's makes delicious soups in flavors your family knows and loves with quality, farm-grown ingredients in every cup. M'm! M'm! Good! This product is packaged in a metal can, and is shelf-stable. One (1) 10.75 oz can of Campbell's Condensed Tomato Bisque Soup Vegetarian soup crafted with farm-fresh cream and tomato pieces to provide a full serving of veggies in every cup Top it with oyster crackers, season it with fresh herbs, or pair it with a classic grilled cheese sandwich for something quick and easy This convenient canned soup is a year-round pantry staple and the perfect comfort food on a chilly day or when you're feeling under the weather Each 10.75 oz recyclable can contains about 2.5 servings of microwave soup and features a non-BPA lining Mix the condensed soup with 1 can of water and microwave on high for 2.5 to 3 minutes, or heat in a pot on the stove, stirring occasionally This product is packaged in a metal can, and is shelf-stable.",
